{
  "sheet": "hooks",
  "purpose": "Every place the mashup plugs into DayZ's own scripts. The preflight checks each hook's file really contains the modded class and method, and each was looked up in Bohemia's published scripts (DayZ-Script-Diff, build 1.29.163709).",
